<figure id="A2.T11" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 11: </span>Model quality (task accuracy across eight zero-shot tasks, reported in %) for LLaMA-3.1 8B with different pruning methods. <span id="A2.T11.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">PATCH<math id="A2.T11.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{}^{\text{Tile}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mrow></mrow><mtext>Tile</mtext></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{}^{\text{Tile}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> optimizes tile-based sparsity, enabling a flexible sparsity-quality tradeoff.</figcaption>
<div id="A2.T11.4" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:397.5pt;height:97.9pt;vertical-align:-47.1pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-73.7pt,18.2pt) scale(0.729404787605349,0.729404787605349) ;">
<table id="A2.T11.4.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A2.T11.4.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
